313 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 189 0 R
/E (Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) is rapidly transforming the global business landscape, presenting both unprecedented opportunities and complex challenges for organisations worldwide. For business leaders in Malaysia, the potential of AI is being recognised as an opportunity to maintain competitiveness, foster innovation, and ensure sustainable growth. However, effective oversight of AI is crucial, as unmanaged risks can lead to significant financial, reputational, and operational consequences. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
