316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 189 0 R
/E (While providing frameworks and highlighting best practices, this Primer is intended as a voluntary resource. Its content is adaptable across various sectors and organisations of different sizes. Ultimately, this resource aims to begin the journey of equipping business leaders with the confidence, foresight, and ethical stewardship necessary to lead effectively in an AI-driven future.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
