431 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 200 0 R
/E (Data provenance is a fundamental component of trustworthy AI, as it enables organisations to trace the origin, lineage, and transformation of data used throughout the AI lifecycle. It involves understanding the complete lineage of data, encompassing where the data originated, how it was collected, curated, transformed, and moved throughout an organisation, and how its accuracy has been maintained over time. Keeping a robust data provenance record allows organisations to ascertain the quality of the data based on its origin and subsequent transformations, trace potential sources of errors, update data, and accurately attribute it to its sources. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
432 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 200 0 R
/E (Given that data is a fundamental building block of AI, its quality, quantity, and representativeness directly affect the performance, trustworthiness, and safety of AI systems; poor data quality, for example, can lead to biases and errors, undermining trust and safety. Defining these data governance and quality parameters during the design stage ensures that any proposed project is built on a viable operational foundation before significant capital or resources are allocated.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
433 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 200 0 R
/E (Board considerations:)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
434 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1449 0 R
/E (Does the problem being solved genuinely require an AI solution, or could it be addressed more reliably and cost-effectively through conventional software, automation, or process improvement?)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
435 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1450 0 R
/E (Has management defined clear business objectives, success metrics, and value realisation measures before moving forward?)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
436 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1451 0 R
/E (Does the organisation possess the necessary legal rights, user consent, contractual permissions, and data governance arrangements to use the data required for this AI system?)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
