443 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 201 0 R
/E (Once the problem is understood, organisations can decide whether to build an AI solution internally or acquire one from vendors. This requires a structured evaluation of cost, risk, expertise, long-term support, and data access. A decision framework helps ensure AI solutions are selected based on clearly defined organisational objectives and evidence of value. This evaluation matrix should compare candidate solutions against technical performance, explainability, compliance, and vendor reliability.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
