/E (Before committing to deployment, organisations should assess whether they have the right data, infrastructure, skills, and talent. This includes evaluating data quality \(i.e., accuracy, representativeness, and fairness\), IT infrastructure for storage and compute, and whether staff have the skills to maintain and use the system. A readiness assessment also ensures there is a deployment plan aligned with organisational processes, not just technical capability.)
/Pg 27 0 R
