/E (The regulatory environment surrounding AI is rapidly evolving on a global scale, shifting from a purely technical concern to a strategic, operational, ethical, and legal issue. This dynamic landscape necessitates continuous vigilance and adaptation from organisations, as the pace of technological change and innovation means that governance systems and processes require regular review. Additionally, different countries are adopting varied approaches to regulate AI. )
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
505 0 obj
<<
