/P 207 0 R
/E (Boards should manage AI risk through existing cyber governance: secure-by-design deployment, access control and hardening, monitoring, and incident readiness, recognising that AI can expand the attack surface and create additional fraud vectors)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
