/P 207 0 R
/E (AI-enabled scams, deceptive communications, and spam are not legally novel issues. The Communications and Multimedia \(Amendment\) Act 2025 [Act A1743] introduces stronger measures, including a specific framework targeting unsolicited commercial electronic messages \(UCEM\), with certain provisions coming into operation on dates appointed by the Minister. Boards should ensure controls over AI-driven communications and marketing, and governance for detecting and responding to harmful or misleading AI content.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [9]
>>
