/E (AI systems must be both safe \(i.e., avoiding harmful or erroneous outputs\) and secure \(i.e., resilient to manipulation or attack\). Boards should require that every significant AI deployment undergo cybersecurity assessments and AI-specific safety assessments such as robustness checks, scenario stress-testing and impact or risk assessments \(i.e., evaluating potential harm, bias, and societal impact\).)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
