/P 215 0 R
/E (Anticipate and Manage Workforce Impact)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
638 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 215 0 R
/E (Directors are responsible for overseeing how AI is used throughout the organisation, including systems with which employees and customers interact. Boards should treat AI risk assessment as an ongoing governance exercise, requiring periodic reassessment as systems change in purpose, scale, data, users, context or legal obligations. The organisation should clearly identify who, at board and management levels, has responsibility and is ultimately accountable to the board for decisions regarding AI use. This includes consideration of how to leverage existing governance structures, such as board and management committees.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
