/E (The AI Readiness Evaluation is a tool for proactive leadership, not a set of technical mandates. It forces the necessary shift from reacting to risk to guiding safe, ethical AI use across the enterprise. By giving the board a clear profile across Strategy, Governance, and Capability, the evaluation delivers the insight needed for immediate, targeted action.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [0]
