/E (This Primer has outlined how to adopt AI responsibly across the lifecycle, why oversight should  be calibrated to risk, and how governance should evolve as use cases expand and regulations mature. Boards should treat AI risk assessment as an ongoing governance exercise, requiring periodic reassessment as systems change purpose, scale, data, users, context, or legal obligations.)
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [1]
